# Keep HTML/JS/CSS text files as LF in the working tree.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites every LF to CRLF,
# which on the 500 KB single-file app means 9,407 spurious byte changes
# on each checkout and a permanently noisy diff.
*.html text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
